WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.480
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:14.750 --> 00:16.950
When I was in the dark for the first time,

3
00:17.830 --> 00:19.630
she was the one who gave me light.

4
00:21.350 --> 00:22.160
Does it hurt?

5
00:22.160 --> 00:23.600
She gave me a home.

6
00:25.320 --> 00:26.230
Why are you

7
00:26.230 --> 00:27.440
so weak, child?

8
00:27.510 --> 00:28.970
People are bullying you,

9
00:29.000 --> 00:30.600
and you don't even fight back.

10
00:30.600 --> 00:32.280
If you encounter this again,

11
00:32.350 --> 00:33.880
you need to scold them back,

12
00:33.960 --> 00:34.790
got it?

13
00:36.240 --> 00:38.240
I was afraid of causing you trouble.

14
00:40.390 --> 00:41.710
You silly child.

15
00:42.280 --> 00:43.710
You have a mom now.

16
00:44.270 --> 00:45.990
Mom will teach you what to do.

17
00:46.710 --> 00:47.520
Let's go.

18
00:49.240 --> 00:49.980
Just now,

19
00:50.000 --> 00:51.240
who bullied my child?

20
00:52.240 --> 00:53.070
This child

21
00:53.280 --> 00:54.740
stepped on my vegetables.

22
00:57.110 --> 00:58.920
I can pay for the vegetables she stepped on.

23
00:58.920 --> 01:00.320
But what do you mean by bullying her?

24
01:00.320 --> 01:01.400
Zhang Wenying,

25
01:01.710 --> 01:02.670
you brought a child back all the way

26
01:02.670 --> 01:04.150
from the Northwest.

27
01:04.150 --> 01:05.640
She's not even yours.

28
01:05.710 --> 01:07.040
Is it really necessary?

29
01:07.150 --> 01:08.000
Exactly.

30
01:08.000 --> 01:09.200
Listen up.

31
01:09.640 --> 01:10.900
Her name is Chen Ying.

32
01:11.039 --> 01:12.120
Chen from Chen Fu,

33
01:12.120 --> 01:13.520
Ying from Zhang Wenying.

34
01:14.400 --> 01:16.230
She is my daughter with Chen Fu.

35
01:22.920 --> 01:24.920
Now, the family that protects me

36
01:25.400 --> 01:27.460
is about to fall into the abyss again.

37
01:33.640 --> 01:35.460
I won't let anyone

38
01:35.880 --> 01:37.550
[Copying]

39
01:36.229 --> 01:37.960
break this peace again.

40
03:04.590 --> 03:09.370
[LIGHT THE DARK]

41
03:10.230 --> 03:13.040
[Episode 3]

42
03:52.520 --> 03:53.450
Hello everyone.

43
03:53.560 --> 03:54.670
I'm Chen Ying.

44
03:54.870 --> 03:56.400
I'm here to report for duty.

45
04:02.130 --> 04:04.210
Once the weather gets hot,

46
04:04.470 --> 04:05.840
these buzzing things

47
04:05.840 --> 04:07.030
are all coming out.

48
04:08.560 --> 04:09.430
Let's see

49
04:10.750 --> 04:12.280
if I can swat you to death.

50
04:19.269 --> 04:20.800
Where did you fly to?

51
04:22.270 --> 04:24.190
Where did you fly to?

52
04:27.310 --> 04:28.120
Don't move.

53
04:31.920 --> 04:33.060
Don't move.

54
04:33.120 --> 04:34.290
Don't move.

55
04:35.360 --> 04:36.950
You must not...

56
04:46.190 --> 04:47.210
Chief Sun.

57
04:47.360 --> 04:48.500
Let me introduce you.

58
04:48.500 --> 04:49.510
This is the factory administration's

59
04:49.510 --> 04:50.560
new arrival, Chen Ying,

60
04:50.560 --> 04:51.490
the accountant.

61
04:51.560 --> 04:53.220
Hello, Department Chief Sun.

62
04:53.560 --> 04:55.430
I need to find you a seat.

63
04:55.430 --> 04:56.190
How about

64
04:56.530 --> 04:58.159
you sit opposite Qianqian for now,

65
04:58.159 --> 04:58.630
okay?

66
04:58.630 --> 04:59.270
Right.

67
04:59.630 --> 05:00.760
There's a seat here.

68
05:01.920 --> 05:02.720
Okay.

69
05:03.190 --> 05:04.420
Thank you, Chief Sun.

70
05:04.510 --> 05:05.310
I'm leaving.

71
05:05.580 --> 05:06.780
Take care, Chief Sun.

72
05:09.270 --> 05:10.270
Is it fun to watch?

73
05:11.630 --> 05:13.280
Get back to work.

74
05:19.120 --> 05:20.520
You must be Sun Qianqian.

75
05:22.000 --> 05:23.460
Hello, I'm Chen Ying.

76
05:23.680 --> 05:26.310
I worked at the grassroots level for three years,

77
05:26.310 --> 05:27.600
so I'm not very familiar

78
05:27.600 --> 05:28.960
with this kind of work.

79
05:29.160 --> 05:30.320
I heard you've always been

80
05:30.320 --> 05:32.070
doing finance in the supply department,

81
05:32.070 --> 05:33.530
and you report directly to

82
05:33.530 --> 05:34.750
Department Chief Sun Jie.

83
05:34.750 --> 05:36.390
Next time you go to report,

84
05:36.420 --> 05:37.880
could you take me with you?

85
05:38.000 --> 05:39.680
I want to observe and learn.

86
05:42.480 --> 05:43.360
Learn?

87
05:47.800 --> 05:48.870
Learning is good.

88
05:50.159 --> 05:51.659
I think...

89
05:52.480 --> 05:53.730
Why don't you start learning

90
05:53.730 --> 05:55.190
from the most basic level?

91
05:55.430 --> 05:56.380
Go ahead.

92
05:56.390 --> 05:58.010
Do these accounts properly.

93
05:58.920 --> 05:59.720
Okay.

94
06:04.680 --> 06:05.480
Mr. Qi,

95
06:06.510 --> 06:08.570
who's that sleeping against the car?

96
06:10.040 --> 06:10.800
That's...

97
06:10.800 --> 06:11.720
um...

98
06:11.800 --> 06:13.040
Wan Yang's brother-in-law,

99
06:13.040 --> 06:13.830
Liu Jun.

100
06:16.270 --> 06:18.240
You understand everything

101
06:18.260 --> 06:19.520
I just told you, right?

102
06:19.680 --> 06:20.680
If there's no problem,

103
06:20.680 --> 06:21.560
come down with me.

104
06:21.560 --> 06:22.480
Me, go down?

105
06:24.040 --> 06:24.960
Don't worry.

106
06:25.270 --> 06:26.310
I'm the general manager

107
06:26.310 --> 06:27.240
here now.

108
06:27.360 --> 06:28.680
And I've made a pledge

109
06:28.680 --> 06:29.830
to Wan Yang.

110
06:29.830 --> 06:30.630
If I were to send someone down,

111
06:30.630 --> 06:32.030
they won't say anything.

112
06:32.600 --> 06:33.390
Yes.

113
06:33.710 --> 06:34.510
No.

114
06:35.159 --> 06:36.720
The thing is that everyone knows me here.

115
06:36.720 --> 06:37.560
If I go down,

116
06:37.560 --> 06:38.950
won't it alert them?

117
06:39.480 --> 06:40.350
Then,

118
06:40.370 --> 06:41.630
I won't be able to see or hear

119
06:41.630 --> 06:43.159
what I want to know.

120
06:45.040 --> 06:46.070
That makes sense.

121
06:48.070 --> 06:48.930
How about this?

122
06:49.950 --> 06:51.830
I'll give you my badge.

123
06:51.870 --> 06:53.120
It'll be easier for you

124
06:53.120 --> 06:54.070
to sneak in and out.

125
06:54.070 --> 06:55.159
Be careful.

126
06:56.190 --> 06:57.190
Thank you, Mr. Qi.

127
07:17.800 --> 07:18.560
Be careful.

128
07:28.360 --> 07:29.120
Is it loaded?

129
07:29.120 --> 07:29.680
Yes.

130
07:29.680 --> 07:30.120
Let's go.

131
07:30.120 --> 07:30.680
Okay.

132
07:32.240 --> 07:32.770
Let's go.

133
07:52.630 --> 07:53.600
Pair of twos.

134
07:53.950 --> 07:54.680
Two jokers.

135
07:56.720 --> 07:58.250
You can't beat this, right?

136
07:59.290 --> 08:01.940
Come on, let's get to work.

137
08:02.290 --> 08:03.290
Stop, stop, stop.

138
08:05.770 --> 08:07.120
Thanks for your hard work, Jun.

139
08:07.120 --> 08:08.240
You worked hard.

140
08:08.260 --> 08:09.060
It's nothing.

141
08:09.800 --> 08:11.390
Hurry up and unload.

142
08:12.430 --> 08:13.480
Don't drop it.

143
08:15.750 --> 08:17.600
You'll get your share.

144
08:18.310 --> 08:20.160
We've worked together so many times.

145
08:20.160 --> 08:21.510
Don't you trust me?

146
08:21.510 --> 08:22.240
Right?

147
08:22.390 --> 08:23.630
It's not that I don't trust you.

148
08:23.630 --> 08:25.560
But business is business, you know?

149
08:25.560 --> 08:26.540
Look at you.

150
08:26.630 --> 08:28.950
You're breaking my heart.

151
08:28.950 --> 08:30.540
Do you really need to count?

152
08:30.920 --> 08:32.320
You're really counting?

153
08:32.549 --> 08:33.360
How about this?

154
08:33.360 --> 08:34.630
After we unload the goods

155
08:34.630 --> 08:36.549
and finish the deal, let's have a drink

156
08:36.549 --> 08:38.480
and some late-night snacks, okay?

157
08:40.390 --> 08:41.200
No problem.

158
08:44.360 --> 08:45.960
Just by looking at it and I...

159
08:49.120 --> 08:51.070
I heard your factory

160
08:51.100 --> 08:52.960
is very strict lately.

161
08:53.120 --> 08:54.170
I can't believe Jun

162
08:54.170 --> 08:56.150
still managed to get these things out.

163
08:56.150 --> 08:57.240
You have connections, don't you?

164
08:57.240 --> 08:58.150
Who am I?

165
08:58.630 --> 08:59.980
The factory manager is my brother-in-law.

166
08:59.980 --> 09:01.520
The factory is my home.

167
09:01.840 --> 09:03.510
I can take whatever I want.

168
09:03.510 --> 09:04.680
I can take

169
09:04.710 --> 09:06.120
whenever I want.

170
09:06.140 --> 09:06.930
Alright?

171
09:06.960 --> 09:08.200
You're the best.

172
09:09.200 --> 09:11.300
The pipes you sold me before

173
09:11.320 --> 09:12.670
were of really high quality.

174
09:12.670 --> 09:14.600
If you have more, get me some.

175
09:14.630 --> 09:15.470
No problem.

176
09:16.150 --> 09:17.150
I'll look for them at home.

177
09:17.150 --> 09:17.840
If I have them,

178
09:17.840 --> 09:19.500
I'll bring it to you next time.

179
09:21.550 --> 09:22.840
Thanks.

180
09:22.910 --> 09:24.040
Hurry up, everyone.

181
09:24.600 --> 09:25.080
Hurry up.

182
09:25.080 --> 09:26.510
I'll treat you to supper later.

183
09:26.510 --> 09:28.000
Okay.

184
09:29.080 --> 09:29.960
Who is it? Who?

185
09:31.150 --> 09:31.910
You guys,

186
09:31.910 --> 09:32.790
go look around. Quick!

187
09:32.790 --> 09:33.480
Okay.

188
09:35.320 --> 09:36.920
Hurry up.

189
09:37.270 --> 09:37.960
I'll go.

190
09:38.360 --> 09:39.550
Two of you, go over there.

191
09:39.550 --> 09:40.390
Okay.

192
09:40.750 --> 09:41.630
Up there.

193
09:43.200 --> 09:44.290
Nothing here.

194
09:46.270 --> 09:47.200
Anyone in there?

195
09:47.380 --> 09:48.360
Nothing here.

196
09:49.150 --> 09:50.390
Nothing here either.

197
09:52.600 --> 09:53.800
Nothing here either.

198
09:55.810 --> 09:57.010
Nothing here either.

199
09:58.910 --> 10:00.260
Nothing here either.

200
10:08.030 --> 10:08.630
Anything?

201
10:08.870 --> 10:09.790
No.

202
10:12.510 --> 10:13.380
Jun.

203
10:13.410 --> 10:14.470
There are a lot of stray cats and dogs

204
10:14.470 --> 10:15.590
around here.

205
10:16.030 --> 10:17.120
Let's unload the goods quickly.

206
10:17.120 --> 10:17.960
We'll have a few drinks later.

207
10:17.960 --> 10:19.670
Don't delay our supper.

208
10:20.510 --> 10:21.970
Unload the goods quickly!

209
10:40.630 --> 10:42.750
The pipes you sold me before

210
10:42.750 --> 10:44.120
were of really high quality.

211
10:44.120 --> 10:46.030
If you have more, get me some.

212
10:46.720 --> 10:48.120
It seems this Liu Jun

213
10:48.150 --> 10:49.670
is only capable of petty theft

214
10:49.670 --> 10:51.130
and can't do anything big.

215
10:52.390 --> 10:54.650
Wan Yang wouldn't trust people like him.

216
10:55.540 --> 10:56.760
Besides, Liu Jun pockets

217
10:56.760 --> 10:58.490
everything he steals.

218
10:59.360 --> 11:00.960
It probably has nothing to do

219
11:01.200 --> 11:02.800
with Wan Yang's corruption.

220
11:03.630 --> 11:05.360
Even if he has nothing to do with the corruption,

221
11:05.360 --> 11:06.080
he is still

222
11:06.080 --> 11:07.280
Wan Yang's relative.

223
11:07.910 --> 11:08.970
Most importantly,

224
11:09.840 --> 11:11.480
he's not very smart.

225
11:11.960 --> 11:13.030
I think if we follow him,

226
11:13.030 --> 11:15.160
we'll find some clues sooner or later.

227
11:16.910 --> 11:17.870
Ying, how is your investigation going

228
11:17.870 --> 11:19.330
in the Supply Department?

229
11:19.840 --> 11:21.640
They are all on guard against me.

230
11:22.270 --> 11:23.150
It's okay.

231
11:23.600 --> 11:24.840
I'll keep looking.

232
11:29.960 --> 11:31.520
Eat more vegetables.

233
11:34.840 --> 11:36.380
You know, the two women in that family

234
11:36.380 --> 11:37.840
are quite wild.

235
11:38.080 --> 11:39.870
Zhang Wenying produced that blueprint

236
11:39.870 --> 11:41.430
and blew up her husband.

237
11:41.510 --> 11:42.960
Blowing him up is one thing.

238
11:42.960 --> 11:43.800
But

239
11:43.820 --> 11:46.200
we don’t have the year-end bonus. Yeah.

240
11:46.630 --> 11:47.390
So annoying.

241
11:55.440 --> 11:57.300
Has the broadcasting room moved?

242
11:58.750 --> 12:01.030
Why do you keep running to the supply department

243
12:01.030 --> 12:03.560
instead of staying in the broadcasting room?

244
12:03.750 --> 12:05.330
Is it any of your business?

245
12:08.600 --> 12:09.240
You...

246
12:09.240 --> 12:11.100
Are you friends with Sun Qianqian

247
12:11.320 --> 12:13.300
because she is Sun Qianqian,

248
12:13.510 --> 12:14.440
or because she is

249
12:14.450 --> 12:16.120
Chief Sun Jie's younger sister?

250
12:16.120 --> 12:18.120
Does it have anything to do with you?

251
12:23.630 --> 12:24.840
My mom was the director of the design department

252
12:24.840 --> 12:25.960
for over ten years.

253
12:27.550 --> 12:29.010
The projects she designed

254
12:29.240 --> 12:30.440
saved the factory a lot of money.

255
12:30.440 --> 12:31.370
Do you know that?

256
12:32.750 --> 12:33.750
Every bonus you received

257
12:33.750 --> 12:34.990
during the holidays,

258
12:36.270 --> 12:37.390
every benefit,

259
12:39.750 --> 12:41.410
and the lipstick in your hand,

260
12:42.750 --> 12:44.810
which of these isn't thanks to my mom?

261
12:46.200 --> 12:47.200
Gossip about her?

262
12:48.510 --> 12:49.710
You don't deserve to.

263
12:50.390 --> 12:51.240
Are you crazy?

264
12:51.240 --> 12:53.370
My new lipstick!

265
12:53.440 --> 12:55.240
Chen Ying, you have to pay for it.

266
12:57.550 --> 12:58.360
Director Zhang.

267
12:58.360 --> 12:59.840
Given your health condition,

268
12:59.840 --> 13:01.360
you need to be hospitalized for a checkup.

269
13:01.360 --> 13:03.220
You can go home after the checkup.

270
13:03.360 --> 13:05.150
But the investigation of the accident

271
13:05.150 --> 13:06.600
is not completely over.

272
13:06.720 --> 13:09.000
You still have to cooperate with the superiors' investigation.

273
13:09.000 --> 13:10.060
Do you understand?

274
13:10.440 --> 13:11.440
I understand.

275
13:11.670 --> 13:12.390
Master.

276
13:13.510 --> 13:14.200
It's okay.

277
13:15.630 --> 13:16.550
Drink some water

278
13:16.550 --> 13:17.950
and moisten your throat.

279
13:30.390 --> 13:31.200
Qi Mo.

280
13:31.550 --> 13:33.040
Should I praise your loyalty

281
13:33.040 --> 13:34.840
or scold you for being stubborn?

282
13:38.550 --> 13:40.080
I heard you are now

283
13:40.120 --> 13:42.080
the leader of the restoration project.

284
13:42.080 --> 13:43.960
Don't come to me anymore then.

285
13:46.240 --> 13:47.440
You are my Master.

286
13:48.440 --> 13:50.030
It's only right for me to visit you.

287
13:50.030 --> 13:51.290
Listen to your Master.

288
13:52.080 --> 13:52.960
You are a talent.

289
13:52.960 --> 13:54.630
You need a bigger stage to show yourself.

290
13:54.630 --> 13:55.870
You can't act out of spite

291
13:55.870 --> 13:57.550
and bury your talent.

292
13:57.870 --> 13:58.510
Mom.

293
13:59.440 --> 14:00.200
Mom.

294
14:00.870 --> 14:01.670
Mr. Qi.

295
14:02.630 --> 14:03.240
Mom.

296
14:03.240 --> 14:03.830
We knew

297
14:03.860 --> 14:04.680
you were transferred to the hospital,

298
14:04.680 --> 14:05.360
so we hurried over.

299
14:05.360 --> 14:06.240
Are you okay?

300
14:07.440 --> 14:08.840
As long as you don't cause me trouble

301
14:08.840 --> 14:09.480
and don't make me angry,

302
14:09.480 --> 14:10.440
I'll be fine.

303
14:12.270 --> 14:13.840
I'm warning you two,

304
14:14.080 --> 14:15.610
especially you, Chen Shan.

305
14:16.550 --> 14:18.210
If you cause any more trouble,

306
14:18.320 --> 14:19.980
I'll die right in front of you.

307
14:21.720 --> 14:23.120
Hurry up and promise Mom.

308
14:23.960 --> 14:25.560
I won't dare do it again, Mom.

309
14:26.120 --> 14:26.750
Mom.

310
14:27.270 --> 14:28.550
Mom, don't be angry.

311
14:32.630 --> 14:33.270
Alright.

312
14:34.030 --> 14:35.230
You guys go out first.

313
14:35.720 --> 14:37.440
I have a few words to say to your godfather.

314
14:37.440 --> 14:38.000
Okay.

315
14:41.750 --> 14:43.230
Give it to me.

316
14:44.200 --> 14:44.730
Go ahead.

317
14:51.870 --> 14:53.180
I didn't tell Master

318
14:53.360 --> 14:55.560
that you went to the construction site.

319
14:56.390 --> 14:58.730
I will cover

320
14:58.870 --> 14:59.840
for you two.

321
15:00.960 --> 15:02.030
Thank you, Mr. Qi.

322
15:04.240 --> 15:06.040
Just call me brother from now on.

323
15:10.060 --> 15:11.550
I'd better call you Mr. Qi.

324
15:13.480 --> 15:14.360
Okay.

325
15:15.240 --> 15:16.700
Call me whatever you want.

326
15:38.000 --> 15:38.800
Open the door.

327
15:45.750 --> 15:46.880
Chief Sun,

328
15:47.320 --> 15:49.150
you came to inspect in person.

329
15:50.200 --> 15:52.000
I don't care how you usually are,

330
15:52.240 --> 15:53.990
but this project is quite special.

331
15:53.990 --> 15:55.990
You'd better keep your hands clean.

332
15:56.870 --> 15:58.030
Transporting goods

333
15:58.270 --> 15:59.460
is the normal work

334
15:59.490 --> 16:00.530
of our transport department.

335
16:00.530 --> 16:01.740
What do you mean?

336
16:01.840 --> 16:02.990
Whether it's normal work,

337
16:02.990 --> 16:04.080
you and I both know.

338
16:04.440 --> 16:05.320
Anyway, I've already said

339
16:05.320 --> 16:06.450
what I needed to say.

340
16:06.550 --> 16:08.080
You'd better think it over.

341
16:08.270 --> 16:09.240
Without my word,

342
16:09.440 --> 16:11.000
no one is allowed to open the door.

343
16:11.000 --> 16:11.800
Open the door.

344
16:13.720 --> 16:14.440
Sun Jie.

345
16:15.750 --> 16:16.550
Sun Jie.

346
16:17.390 --> 16:18.800
Who do you think you are?

347
