429
20:25.640 --> 20:26.640
What's your name?

430
20:27.290 --> 20:28.160
Who am I?

431
20:28.570 --> 20:30.050
The factory director is my brother-in-law.

432
20:30.050 --> 20:31.400
The factory is my home.

433
20:31.840 --> 20:33.570
I can take whatever I want.

434
20:33.570 --> 20:36.720
I can take whatever I want. No, I didn’t put it.

435
20:37.010 --> 20:38.290
You are the best.

436
20:39.200 --> 20:41.200
The pipes you sold me before

437
20:41.200 --> 20:42.680
