443
20:49.390 --> 20:50.390
Who am I?

444
20:50.570 --> 20:52.170
The factory director is my brother-in-law.

445
20:52.170 --> 20:53.570
The factory is my home.

446
20:53.860 --> 20:55.490
I can take whatever I want.

447
20:55.510 --> 20:56.680
And I can take it

448
20:56.710 --> 20:58.740
