462
21:25.200 --> 21:26.260
Don't worry, Ying.

463
21:26.600 --> 21:28.120
When the time comes, I'll follow Liu Jun.

464
21:28.120 --> 21:28.840
I'll definitely find

465
21:28.840 --> 21:29.840
