515
23:44.720 --> 23:46.030
[713 Project Pipe Restoration Meeting]

516
23:49.490 --> 23:50.290
Good.

517
23:51.090 --> 23:51.840
Good.

518
24:13.770 --> 24:14.840
From today on,

519
24:15.840 --> 24:17.240
all levels of the factory

520
24:17.680 --> 24:19.290
