562
26:48.840 --> 26:50.640
Master, wait for me a moment.

563
26:51.330 --> 26:52.360
Sun Jie. Thank you.

564
26:52.360 --> 26:53.120
Sun Jie!

565
26:53.770 --> 26:54.970
