587
27:55.880 --> 27:57.680
Boss, Mr. Qi is here.

588
27:59.490 --> 28:00.290
Director Wan.

589
28:14.730 --> 28:15.390
Nice rally.

590
28:15.920 --> 28:16.680
Director Wan,

591
28:16.680 --> 28:17.920
