592
28:17.920 --> 28:19.970
It was too sudden that you can't catch it, right?

593
28:19.970 --> 28:22.490
You probably need to practice more often.

594
28:23.910 --> 28:26.130
To take the director's seat today,

595
28:26.240 --> 28:27.870
