658
31:22.160 --> 31:22.880
Liu Jun.

659
31:26.140 --> 31:28.290
-I told you not to do bad things! -Sister! Sister!

660
31:28.290 --> 31:29.910
I told you not to do bad things.

661
31:29.910 --> 31:31.570
