683
33:11.400 --> 33:12.050
Mom.

684
33:13.360 --> 33:14.490
How did Ying's

685
33:14.490 --> 33:15.890
biological parents die?

686
33:20.010 --> 33:21.340
Why are you asking this?

687
33:21.680 --> 33:22.730
Did someone say something to you?

688
33:22.730 --> 33:23.400
Never mind that.

689
33:23.400 --> 33:24.400
Answer me first.

690
33:25.810 --> 33:27.680
How did her parents die?

691
33:30.620 --> 33:31.560
Shan.

692
33:33.090 --> 33:34.570
A lot happened in the past.

693
33:35.200 --> 33:36.920
I can't explain it all right now.

694
33:36.920 --> 33:38.200
Go find your sister first.

695
33:38.200 --> 33:39.530
When the time is right,

696
33:39.530 --> 33:40.970
I will tell you.

697
33:41.160 --> 33:42.560
What are you hiding from?

698
33:43.490 --> 33:44.750
What are you afraid of?

699
33:46.680 --> 33:48.160
How many more things

700
33:48.160 --> 33:49.490
are you keeping from us?

701
33:50.290 --> 33:51.550
You don't understand.

702
33:51.730 --> 33:52.840
I don't.

703
33:53.840 --> 33:54.770
I don't understand why

704
33:54.770 --> 33:56.050
you never tell us

705
33:56.050 --> 33:57.200
anything.

706
33:58.120 --> 33:59.890
That blueprint incident

707
34:00.490 --> 34:02.550
had nothing to do with you,

708
34:02.920 --> 34:03.570
yet you admitted to it

709
34:03.570 --> 34:04.920
so willingly.

710
34:06.440 --> 34:07.160
Is it because

711
34:07.160 --> 34:08.239
Wan Yang helped you

712
34:08.239 --> 34:10.040
suppress this matter back then?

713
34:11.719 --> 34:14.120
You and Dad caused a construction accident

714
34:15.449 --> 34:17.710
that killed Ying's biological parents.

715
34:25.199 --> 34:25.889
Mom.

716
34:27.010 --> 34:27.530
Mom.

717
34:37.150 --> 34:39.400
Everything I just said

718
34:42.760 --> 34:44.280
is true, right?

719
34:55.280 --> 34:57.540
You shouldn't have lied to her like this.

720
34:58.760 --> 34:59.490
Is it fair to her

721
34:59.490 --> 35:00.760
that you did this?

722
35:00.760 --> 35:01.570
Shan.

723
35:02.180 --> 35:03.660
Stop talking.

724
35:03.930 --> 35:04.890
Our family still

725
35:04.890 --> 35:07.600
-needs to be in tact. -How?

726
35:09.730 --> 35:10.720
You...

727
35:10.750 --> 35:13.190
You and Dad have lied to her for so many years.

728
35:13.190 --> 35:14.570
Am I supposed to play along

729
35:14.570 --> 35:16.090
and keep lying to her?

730
35:43.200 --> 35:44.760
It was you

731
35:47.640 --> 35:49.320
who've always told me

732
35:49.320 --> 35:51.140
since I was little

733
35:52.460 --> 35:55.700
to be honest and upright.

734
36:00.490 --> 36:02.160
I really don't know.

735
36:04.370 --> 36:05.530
Are you still the brave

736
36:05.530 --> 36:07.370
and upright mom?

737
36:10.870 --> 36:11.890
Are you still

738
36:11.890 --> 36:13.200
the female warrior,

739
36:13.200 --> 36:14.450
Zhang Wenying?

740
37:00.750 --> 37:02.030
Why are you here?

741
37:02.050 --> 37:03.300
I looked everywhere for you.

742
37:03.300 --> 37:05.100
You didn't even answer my calls.

743
37:05.300 --> 37:07.300
Mom has been waiting for you at home.

744
37:15.160 --> 37:16.200
I'm happy today

745
37:16.600 --> 37:17.660
so I wanted a drink.

746
37:19.350 --> 37:20.810
Mom was discharged today.

747
37:21.530 --> 37:22.660
So you can have some.

748
37:22.670 --> 37:23.840
She won't blame you.

749
37:27.370 --> 37:28.490
Let's go home.

750
37:51.680 --> 37:52.940
Go call Mom for dinner.

751
38:05.640 --> 38:06.600
Time to eat, Mom.

752
38:09.490 --> 38:10.760
Is she asleep?

753
38:12.890 --> 38:13.530
Mom.

754
38:19.850 --> 38:20.490
Mom.

755
38:40.640 --> 38:41.890
What's wrong, Shan?

756
38:45.150 --> 38:46.100
What's wrong?

757
38:52.640 --> 38:54.170
I, Zhang Wenying,

758
38:54.490 --> 38:56.180
have lived half my life.

759
38:56.410 --> 38:57.280
As for my work,

760
38:57.430 --> 38:58.470
my husband,

761
38:58.910 --> 39:00.110
and my children,

762
39:00.410 --> 39:02.340
I haven't handled any of them well.

763
39:03.070 --> 39:04.640
I have failed my family.

764
39:05.000 --> 39:07.220
I have failed the organization that trained me.

765
39:07.220 --> 39:08.890
I have failed this world.

766
39:10.050 --> 39:11.910
I hope to make amends in the next life

767
39:11.910 --> 39:13.310
to atone for my past sins.

768
39:20.280 --> 39:21.750
Zhang Wenying is dead.

769
39:21.890 --> 39:23.050
Will her two kids

770
39:23.050 --> 39:24.910
come to the plant to make trouble?

771
39:26.800 --> 39:29.330
Fledglings without an old bird's protection

772
39:29.570 --> 39:31.010
are considered tough

773
39:32.280 --> 39:34.050
if they manage to flutter out of the nest.

774
39:34.050 --> 39:35.090
I'm just a little worried

775
39:35.090 --> 39:36.320
about Chen Ying.

776
39:36.800 --> 39:37.720
Ever since she arrived at the supply department,

777
39:37.720 --> 39:38.920
she hasn't been idle.

778
39:39.050 --> 39:40.600
She's been asking around all day long

779
39:40.600 --> 39:41.370
and almost got her hands

780
39:41.370 --> 39:42.600
on the account book.

781
39:42.890 --> 39:45.200
If this continues, she'll be a problem sooner or later.

782
39:45.200 --> 39:46.280
Do you think we need

783
39:46.280 --> 39:47.200
to transfer her to

784
39:47.200 --> 39:48.640
an unimportant department

785
39:48.640 --> 39:50.160
to avoid future trouble?

786
39:50.680 --> 39:51.850
Just kick her out.

787
39:53.280 --> 39:54.810
As for Chen Shan...

788
39:54.840 --> 39:56.640
Zhang Wenying was a smart woman.

789
39:57.160 --> 39:59.220
But despite being smart all her life,

790
39:59.390 --> 40:01.420
she left her child

791
40:01.750 --> 40:03.490
a deadly problem in the end.

792
40:03.720 --> 40:05.340
What happened recently,

793
40:05.570 --> 40:06.680
you've seen it all.

794
40:07.690 --> 40:10.420
Some things are happening faster than expected.

795
40:12.840 --> 40:14.770
I might have to change my approach.

796
40:15.180 --> 40:17.910
The most important thing is a smooth transition.

797
40:18.910 --> 40:20.600
If I retire early,

798
40:20.850 --> 40:23.220
it won't be easy for you in the plant either.

799
40:23.220 --> 40:24.950
Wherever you want to go by then,

800
40:25.200 --> 40:26.160
I'll arrange it.

801
40:27.370 --> 40:28.460
Thank you, chief.

802
40:28.490 --> 40:30.020
I'll do whatever you say.

803
40:45.450 --> 40:47.310
Zhang Wenying's death and you...

804
40:50.040 --> 40:51.920
Have you been so busy lately

805
40:51.940 --> 40:53.470
that you've lost your mind?

806
40:54.390 --> 40:56.250
You never used to ask about things

807
40:56.890 --> 40:58.160
I don't mention.

808
41:01.570 --> 41:02.630
I spoke out of turn.

809
41:21.630 --> 41:22.500
Wan Yang.

810
41:23.010 --> 41:24.870
I'm not done with you, you hear me?

811
41:25.450 --> 41:26.450
How dare you use that incident

812
41:26.450 --> 41:27.800
to threaten my son!

813
41:27.850 --> 41:29.890
Calm down.

814
41:29.920 --> 41:31.190
Chen is dead

815
41:31.210 --> 41:32.700
and I took the blame.

816
41:32.730 --> 41:34.980
And you still want to wipe us out?

817
41:35.010 --> 41:36.470
Then let's all go down together.

818
41:36.470 --> 41:37.320
I'm telling you,

819
41:37.320 --> 41:38.640
I'm turning myself in tomorrow.

820
41:38.640 --> 41:39.680
I will explain

821
41:39.680 --> 41:40.600
everything clearly.

822
41:40.600 --> 41:41.160
Wan Yang,

823
41:41.160 --> 41:42.320
just you wait!
